{
  "description": "Agent manifest maxima vectors (Agent Capability Standard 1.2.0, section 5.15.1), against ontology 2.2.0. Normative. A manifest's maxima are the highest `risk` and the OR of `mutation`, `requires_checkpoint` and `requires_approval` over its capabilities' ontology values (low and false for none); its read-only maxima the same over the capabilities whose ontology `mutation` is false. The join of several maxima is the highest risk and the OR of each boolean. A manifest that lists a capability the ontology does not define has no maxima (null), and neither does a join that includes it.",
